<section class="protocols" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="protocols-title"><div class="protocols-inner"><header class="protocols-intro"><h2 id="protocols-title"><span>90% AI. 10% Human.</span><br>100% Accountability.</h2><p>Entire floors of people exist just to triage monitoring alerts manually. FSM Dispatch replaces reactive, repetitive work with an AI-native uptime layer for critical infrastructure.</p></header><article class="protocol-row" aria-labelledby="protocol-title-0"><div class="protocol-copy"><p class="protocol-label">Protocol 01</p><h3 id="protocol-title-0">Alert Ingestion<br>&amp; Triage</h3><p class="protocol-description">AI ingests monitoring alerts from any critical system (SCADA, NOC, BMS) and instantly triages severity to prevent invisible downtime.</p></div><figure class="protocol-visual has-diagram"><img class="protocol-texture" src="/assets/protocol-texture-1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><svg class="protocol-ingestion" viewBox="0 0 640 400" role="img" aria-label="SCADA, NOC and BMS monitoring signals flow into severity triage">
