<article class="protocol-row" aria-labelledby="protocol-title-1"><div class="protocol-copy"><p class="protocol-label">Protocol 02</p><h3 id="protocol-title-1">Autonomous<br>AI Dispatching</h3><p class="protocol-description">FSM matches the alert to the right field engineer based on proximity and skill, sending the job with full context.</p></div><figure class="protocol-visual has-dashboard"><img class="protocol-texture" src="/assets/protocol-texture-2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img class="protocol-dashboard" src="/assets/protocol-dashboard-1.png" alt="AI Dispatch status" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></article>
<article class="protocol-row" aria-labelledby="protocol-title-2"><div class="protocol-copy"><p class="protocol-label">Protocol 03</p><h3 id="protocol-title-2">Resolution &amp;<br>Automated Closing</h3><p class="protocol-description">The system tracks SLAs in real-time and logs resolution data automatically, ensuring 100% accountability from alert to closure.</p></div><figure class="protocol-visual has-dashboard"><img class="protocol-texture" src="/assets/protocol-texture-3.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img class="protocol-dashboard" src="/assets/protocol-dashboard-2.png" alt="Resolution status and SLA tracking" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></article>
<article class="protocol-row" aria-labelledby="protocol-title-3"><div class="protocol-copy"><p class="protocol-label">Native Optimization</p><h3 id="protocol-title-3">Outcome-Based<br>Uptime</h3><p class="protocol-description">We align our success with your uptime. Land with 500 ATMs, expand to 5,000—our platform scales seamlessly with your asset count.</p><a class="cta cta-primary protocol-call" href="https://www.avishkarai.com/#book-call">Book a Call <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><figure class="protocol-visual has-dashboard"><img class="protocol-dashboard" src="/assets/protocol-dashboard-3.png" alt="Infrastructure SLA tracking" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></article></div></section>
<section class="uptime-scroll" id="uptime-cycle" aria-labelledby="uptime-title"><div class="uptime-stage"><div class="uptime-window"><div class="uptime-track"><div class="uptime-intro"><h2 id="uptime-title">AI-Native Uptime For<br><span>Critical Infrastructure</span></h2><p>FSM Dispatch handles the entire uptime cycle—from alert ingestion to resolution—with 90% autonomous decision-making.</p><a class="agent-case uptime-case" href="https://www.avishkarai.com/case%20study.pdf">View Case Study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><article class="uptime-step" aria-labelledby="uptime-step-1"><span class="uptime-step-number" aria-hidden="true">.01</span><h3 id="uptime-step-1">Autonomous AI Dispatching</h3><p>AI triages alert severity, matches the right engineer, and sends jobs with full operational context to ensure rapid response.</p><div class="uptime-step-visual"><div class="uptime-flow" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>01</span><p>Alert triage</p><i>✓</i></div><div><span>02</span><p>Engineer matching</p><i>✓</i></div><div><span>03</span><p>Job dispatch</p><i>↗</i></div></div></div></article>
<article class="uptime-step" aria-labelledby="uptime-step-2"><span class="uptime-step-number" aria-hidden="true">.02</span><h3 id="uptime-step-2">Real-time SLA Tracking</h3><p>The platform tracks resolution progress and logs data automatically, eliminating manual follow-ups and human chasing.</p><div class="uptime-step-visual"><div class="uptime-sla" aria-hidden="true"><div class="uptime-sla-head"><span>Resolution cycle</span><div class="uptime-sla-ring">SLA</div></div><div class="uptime-sla-row"><span>Response</span><i></i></div><div class="uptime-sla-row"><span>Resolution</span><i></i></div><div class="uptime-sla-row"><span>Closure</span><i></i></div></div></div></article>
<article class="uptime-step" aria-labelledby="uptime-step-3"><span class="uptime-step-number" aria-hidden="true">.03</span><h3 id="uptime-step-3">Asset-Driven Scaling</h3><p>Increase your operational output as your network grows without adding headcount or new coordination layers.</p><div class="uptime-step-visual"><div class="uptime-network" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 460 170"><g class="uptime-network-lines"><path d="M60 35L230 85"/><path d="M60 135L230 85"/><path d="M145 85L230 85"/><path d="M315 85L230 85"/><path d="M400 35L230 85"/><path d="M400 135L230 85"/></g><g class="uptime-network-nodes"><circle cx="60" cy="35" r="10"/><circle cx="60" cy="135" r="10"/><circle cx="145" cy="85" r="10"/><circle cx="315" cy="85" r="10"/><circle cx="400" cy="35" r="10"/><circle cx="400" cy="135" r="10"/></g><g class="uptime-network-signals"><circle cx="60" cy="35" r="3"/><circle cx="60" cy="135" r="3"/><circle cx="145" cy="85" r="3"/><circle cx="315" cy="85" r="3"/><circle cx="400" cy="35" r="3"/><circle cx="400" cy="135" r="3"/></g><circle class="uptime-network-core" cx="230" cy="85" r="30"/><path class="uptime-network-check" d="M219 85L227 93L242 77"/></svg><div class="uptime-network-caption"><span class="uptime-asset-count">6 assets connected</span><span>One uptime layer</span><span>Scale</span></div></div></div></article></div></div><div class="uptime-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span class="uptime-progress-fill"></span><span class="uptime-progress-dot"></span></div></div></section>
