<article class="native-card"><div class="native-card-top"><span class="native-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="13" width="54" height="38" rx="4"/><circle cx="24" cy="32" r="13"/><path d="M24 19v26M11 32h26M15 23l18 18M15 41l18-18M44 23h8M44 32h8M44 41h8"/></svg></span><span class="native-index">03</span></div><h3>HVAC &amp; BMS</h3><p>Smart monitoring for high-value climate systems. Filter out noise from hundreds of daily alerts to focus on critical temperature and power failures immediately.</p><div class="native-card-foot"><span class="native-status" aria-hidden="true"></span>Critical climate systems</div></article>
